# Deterministic cooperative concurrency primitives.

Action KuroMakeChannel;
    Call MakeChannel;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroSend Channel, Value;
    Call Send Channel, Value;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroReceive Channel;
    Call Receive Channel;
    Return @_;
Done.

Action KuroChannelHas Channel;
    Call ChannelHas Channel;
    Return @_;
Done.
